{"tayoreva kftyaktaKalarTaH": [{"id": "tayoreva kftyaktaKalarTAH", "headword": "तयोरेव कृत्यक्तखलर्थाः", "headword_slp1": "tayoreva kftyaktaKalarTAH", "fold": "tayoreva kftyaktaKalarTaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes called कृत्य and the affix called क्त and those that have the sense of खल् have only these last two senses, viz. an action and an object (भाव and कर्म).\n\nTerms: कृत्य and क्त", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["तयोरेव कृत्यक्तखलर्थाः ३.४.७०", "३.४.७०", "३.४.७० तयोरेव कृत्यक्तखलर्थाः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["tayoreva kftyaktaKalarTAH ३.४.७०", "३.४.७०", "३.४.७० tayoreva kftyaktaKalarTAH"]}], "tayordarhilO ca cCandasi": [{"id": "tayordArhilO ca cCandasi", "headword": "तयोर्दार्हिलौ च च्छन्दसि", "headword_slp1": "tayordArhilO ca cCandasi", "fold": "tayordarhilO ca cCandasi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the two प्रातिपदिक (Nominal Stems) इदम् and तद् come respectively the affixes दा and र्हिल् in the छन्दस् (Vedas) and also other affixes.\n\nTerms: दा and र्हिल्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["तयोर्दार्हिलौ च च्छन्दसि ५.३.२०", "५.३.२०", "५.३.२० तयोर्दार्हिलौ च च्छन्दसि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["tayordArhilO ca cCandasi ५.३.२०", "५.३.२०", "५.३.२० tayordArhilO ca cCandasi"]}], "tayoryvavaci sanhitayam": [{"id": "tayoryvAvaci saMhitAyAm", "headword": "तयोर्य्वावचि संहितायाम्", "headword_slp1": "tayoryvAvaci saMhitAyAm", "fold": "tayoryvavaci sanhitayam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "For these vowels इ or उ are substituted य् and व् when a vowel follows them in a संहिता (in an unbroken flow of speech).\n\nTerms: प्लुत", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["तयोर्य्वावचि संहितायाम् ८.२.१०८", "८.२.१०८", "८.२.१०८ तयोर्य्वावचि संहितायाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["tayoryvAvaci saMhitAyAm ८.२.१०८", "८.२.१०८", "८.२.१०८ tayoryvAvaci saMhitAyAm"]}]}